guidance_log.original:
Since your MMSC URL is not set in the APN settings, please reset your APN settings to the default. This will configure the correct settings for MMS. After resetting the APN settings, you will need to reboot your device for the changes to take effect.

Please perform the reset_apn_settings() action first.
{"action":"reset_apn_settings"}

